# Shrinking the terminal to 20x6 in Upcoming and growing it back keeps the focused entry, and the view still works.
file <<END
- One @due({today+1})
- Two @due({today+2})
- Three @due({today+3})
- Four @due({today+4})
- Five @due({today+5})
END
keys gU G k
see ▌ - Four
resize 20 6
see Four
resize 100 30
see ▌ - Four
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- One @due({today+1})
- Two @due({today+2})
- Three @due({today+3})
- Four @due({today+4}) @done({today})
- Five @due({today+5})
END
